{"unit_id": "tag:02KX:proof", "translation": "局部有限型（locally of finite type）这一性质在基变换（base change）下保持，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>。局部有限型（locally of finite type）这一性质在基底（base）上是Zariski局部（local）的，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。设<MATH_0004>是仿射开集（affine open）。则<MATH_0005>是仿射（affine）的，且在<MATH_0006>上是有限型（finite type）的。记<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>、<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>。我们知道<MATH_0011>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的，<MATH_0012>且<MATH_0013>是有限型（finite type）的。我们须证明<MATH_0014>是有限型（finite type）的。这正是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>的结果。可得<MATH_0015>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。因此引理<REF_0004>适用，结论得证。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}], "unk